## Project Overview

This repository documents a comprehensive web application penetration test against the **OWASP Juice Shop**, a deliberately vulnerable online store used for security training.

### Key Achievements
- ✅ Identified and exploited **SQL Injection** for admin login bypass
- ✅ Discovered **Broken Access Control** on API endpoints
- ✅ Demonstrated **Reflected XSS** vulnerability
- ✅ Documented sensitive data exposure risks
- ✅ Provided professional remediation recommendations

